48,2,3,talk,Mio,,It is the only one that doesn't need a new field crew.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,It bypasses the external hardware friction. It is the safest path.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,I am convinced. The bank tool is the only one that fits our constraints.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. The data supports it.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minako,,It protects our cash flow. I support it.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,It solves my hiring problem. I am in.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
